><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260424/1124388045794578432814267.jpeg/YdVwbuR5iI1iu6ZGEyoJNUQGZhrl0xbv6bjlO-m45Ts\" alt=\"「怪談咖啡廳 Horror Night」店內裝修（「怪談咖啡廳 Horror Night」官網）\"><figcaption>「怪談咖啡廳 Horror Night」店內裝修（「怪談咖啡廳 Horror Night」官網）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「日本這些事兒」授權轉載，微信公眾號：riben66666666】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-13T11:36:22.378409+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":4429,"images":39,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}